  "articleBody": "It's tough when you've put in the effort to stage your luxury home, but the offers just aren't rolling in. You might be scratching your head, wondering what went wrong. Oftentimes, what feels right to you might not be hitting the mark with potential buyers. Staging isn't just about making a home look nice; it's about creating an aspirational vision that resonates with your target market. If your staging isn't doing that, it could be why buyers are passing by.",
  "datePublished": "2026-10-01"
